              "type": "text",
              "text": "In December 2005, I was invited to participate in the conference on the music of greater Khorassan and Transoxiana in Tehran.  With the generous help of friends, colleagues, and the parents of one of my students, I was fortunate to attend a number of music-related events and document them."
